---
title: Chicken Wings
servings: 4
prep time: 10m
cook time: 40m
locale: en
difficulty: Easy
course: Main
---

Mix the @garlic{3%cloves}(peeled and crushed) into @lemon juce{4%tbsp}. Stir with the @olive oil{3%tbsp}, @oregano{1%tbsp}, @paprika{1%tbsp}, @black pepper{1%tsp}(freshly ground), and @salt to form a marinade.

Brush the @chicken wings{16} with the marinade.

Heat the oven to 220°C and cook the chicken on a #wire rack{} for 30 to ~{40%minutes}.